-- Balaklava, 25 October 1854: who could see what.
-- Grid: north_valley.asc, cut from Copernicus GLO-30 tile N44 E033 with GDAL 3.8.4
-- (33.565-33.665 E, 44.518-44.552 N, 1 arc second, values to 0.1 m).
-- Produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 (c) DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and (c) Airbus Defence
